            "line": 738,
            "text": "theorem jet_inverseMixed (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (r : ℕ) (hr : 1 ≤ r)\n    (A B : AxisSpace I ε) (n m : ℕ) {x : ℝ} (hx : x ∈ I.interval) :\n    inputJet I ε (inverseMixed I hε r hr A B) n m x =\n      differentialFamily I ε r 1 (fun j => (j : ℝ)) A B n m x"
